  "lessons": [
    {
      "key": "lesson-1",
      "name": "Mix & Move with AI",
      "absolute_position": 1,
      "lockable": false,
      "has_lesson_plan": true,
      "relative_position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "overview": "In this 45-minute activity, students will explore how creativity, coding, and artificial intelligence come together to bring dance and music to life. By designing a custom dancer, generating and modifying code for a musical remix, and choreographing moves to the beat, students will learn foundational computer science concepts like sequencing and parallelism, alongside AI concepts like prompting and iteration.\n\nStudents will gain confidence in their creative abilities and deepen their understanding of how AI can enhance, not replace, human creativity. They’ll also be introduced to careers that blend art, technology, and AI through an inspiring spotlight from a professional in the music and dance industry. The goal is for students to see themselves as creators—using AI as a tool for imagination, innovation, and self-expression.",
        "purpose": "This lesson is designed to show students that coding and AI go hand in hand to amplify creativity and expression. In Mix & Move with AI, students will design their own dancer, remix music, and choreograph a performance using code. Along the way, they’ll explore coding concepts like sequencing and parallelism and AI concepts like prompting and iteration.\n\nStudents will see how the creative process of designing, testing, and refining with AI mirrors the way artists, musicians, and coders bring ideas to life. By the end of the lesson, they’ll understand that AI can be a powerful tool for imagination and innovation, but that they are ultimately the ones in charge of the final product.",
        "student_overview": "In this 45-minute activity, you’ll use Code.org’s Mix & Move with AI to design your own dancer, mix music from artists like Sabrina Carpenter, Benson Boone, and Shakira, and code your own dance performance. You’ll learn how AI can help you create faster while staying in control of your ideas, explore key coding skills like sequencing and parallelism, and discover how creativity, technology, and AI come together to make something amazing."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "lesson.key": "lesson-1",
        "lesson_group.key": "",
        "script.name": "mix-move-ai-2025"
      }
    }
  ],
